{"4995090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Revolver 21", "steam_appid": 4995090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Revolver 21</i> is a narrative card game set in the context of the Soviet Union during World War II.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an employee of <strong>АКИМ</strong>, most commonly known as <i>“the Commissariat”</i>. Your current task is in regards to a young soldier named Mikhail, whose behavior suggests profound attachment to a... <i>game of Blackjack?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play rounds of <strong>Blackjack</strong> using a fully <i>custom-designed</i> deck;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At the end of every round, partake in a little game of <strong>Russian Roulette</strong> where the loser pulls the trigger;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use <strong>items</strong> granted by the Commissariat to tilt the odds! Corruption's always been the government's favorite game, after all; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn <strong>why</strong> Mikhail’s here, and what he <strong>lost</strong> in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Revolver 21</i> is a narrative card game set in the context of the Soviet Union during World War II.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an employee of <strong>АКИМ</strong>, most commonly known as <i>“the Commissariat”</i>. Your current task is in regards to a young soldier named Mikhail, whose behavior suggests profound attachment to a... <i>game of Blackjack?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play rounds of <strong>Blackjack</strong> using a fully <i>custom-designed</i> deck;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At the end of every round, partake in a